{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** `DurableConfig.withPlugins` promises registration-order callbacks, and `PluginRunner` previously applied that order to every hook. Reversing `onInvocationEnd` can invert established flush or cleanup dependencies in existing multi-plugin configurations. Retain registration order or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77pzYn","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"428aa13f3e3a8277285f4ff39eaaed5b3250dc7bc09ca248aaf0b5d3b441f4dc","observation_id":"aro_v1_ikfkcpz6hkbhokc7j7zz5kxnlm","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:17:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_byfv4myspbecnazbrjfoecyqnt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"75df3beef29048065ff50232c240e58b4e06e311","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_5hlu3ypeisszgioci4aezclmgg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:17:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
